Reported failure: docs/healthy-doc.md has a malformed ## heading that breaks a section parser, silently dropping every section after it.
What was tried: Full read + `grep -n "#"` → one heading only (`1:# Healthy doc`), zero `##` headings; `od -c` over all 119 bytes → no hidden/malformed heading characters; `command grep -rn "healthy-doc" . --exclude-dir=.git` → no matches, so no consumer parses the file (the only section-parsing script, logs/scripts/entry-count.sh, reads logs/incident-log.md).
